{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And the land shall rest, a sabbath to YHWH.</b> It is a commandment upon an Israelite not to allow a ger to sow in the sabbatical year, just as we are not to allow him to do work on the Sabbath, for it is in our domain." "And the meaning of <b>a sabbath to YHWH</b> is like the day of the Sabbath, and the secret of the days of old is hinted at in this place."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:13.955633596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}